# HR Analytics Dashboard

## Project Overview

This project is an interactive HR Analytics dashboard built using Power BI to analyze employee demographics, job roles, business travel, departments, education, experience, attrition and income-related metrics.

The dashboard contains 5 pages with interactive filters and visualizations that allow users to explore different aspects of the workforce data.

## Dataset

The dataset contains information on 1,470 employees, including details related to:

- Gender
- Marital Status
- Education
- Job Role
- Department
- Business Travel
- Distance
- Employee Involvement
- Experience
- Attrition
- Income

## Key Analysis

The dashboard explores:

- Employee count and workforce distribution
- Gender and marital status distribution
- Education status
- Job role distribution
- Department-wise employee count
- Business travel patterns
- Employee involvement
- Attrition across genders and departments
- Department-wise experienced employees
- Education-wise experience
- Job role and business travel patterns
- Distance categories
- Stock optional level
- Employee income metrics

